# The battery indicator in the header (left of the mascot): shown once the divider's reading is plausible, its fill the charge; a low one in the accent colour.
seed 0
wait 3000
shot battery_none.png
battery 600
wait 600
shot battery_mid.png
battery 520
wait 600
shot battery_low.png
battery 700
wait 600
shot battery_full.png
usbpower 1
wait 600
shot battery_usb.png
